        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is a casual single-player item-collecting game... no! It's an epic sci-fi adventure where you'll experience thrilling rescue missions across the vast cosmos!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players take on the role of a member of the “Inter Universal Rescue,” tasked with protecting galactic safety. You'll visit five distinct maps—a massive gas giant, a blazing red giant star, a perilous asteroid field, and a terrifying black hole—where catastrophic accidents and mysterious disasters have occurred. Rescue diverse individuals and solve the incidents unfolding across these worlds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Eventually, you'll confront the utterly despicable evil threatening peace throughout the galaxy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Basic controls are simple.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Movement primarily involves jump acceleration and braking. Enjoy the unique space experience of moving three-dimensionally in microgravity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Touching an opponent will teleport and rescue them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Additionally, switches placed throughout the environment activate by jumping and heading them!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4133400/extras/73a9d78996e7fe405a9438dfc525d1ce.poster.avif?t=1769041601\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4133400/extras/73a9d78996e7fe405a9438dfc525d1ce.webm?t=1769041601\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4133400/extras/73a9d78996e7fe405a9438dfc525d1ce.mp4?t=1769041601\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4133400/extras/9f4d6400f2e59da865e405e87d52e325.avif?t=1769041601\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4133400/extras_big/9f4d6400f2e59da865e405e87d52e325.webp?t=1769041601 width=1560 height=895 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4133400/extras/631479a50cbe86d21b1283294852651c.avif?t=1769041601\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4133400/extras_big/631479a50cbe86d21b1283294852651c.webp?t=1769041601 width=1560 height=823 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The protagonist is KB: a lively girl from the planet Kirikopa. And they are members of the rescue team.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4133400/extras/dc7a42d6b02e9d3a797bb3c61f43232a.avif?t=1769041601\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4133400/extras_big/dc7a42d6b02e9d3a797bb3c61f43232a.webp?t=1769041601 width=1560 height=813 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Several puzzles are placed within the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4133400/extras/708cd6d3c22a7aee3d3f50bfcc6bd1b7.avif?t=1769041601\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4133400/extras_big/708cd6d3c22a7aee3d3f50bfcc6bd1b7.webp?t=1769041601 width=1560 height=388 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you progress, voice calls with Operators will occur, driving the story forward. Through this, the full picture of this world gradually unfolds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the thrill and excitement of freely exploring a breathtakingly vast, three-dimensional cosmic landscape through simple, intuitive character controls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >※This game uses &quot;GoogleAIStudio&quot; for Japanese voiceovers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is a casual single-player item-collecting game... no! It's an epic sci-fi adventure where you'll experience thrilling rescue missions across the vast cosmos!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players take on the role of a member of the “Inter Universal Rescue,” tasked with protecting galactic safety. You'll visit five distinct maps—a massive gas giant, a blazing red giant star, a perilous asteroid field, and a terrifying black hole—where catastrophic accidents and mysterious disasters have occurred. Rescue diverse individuals and solve the incidents unfolding across these worlds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Eventually, you'll confront the utterly despicable evil threatening peace throughout the galaxy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Basic controls are simple.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Movement primarily involves jump acceleration and braking. Enjoy the unique space experience of moving three-dimensionally in microgravity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Touching an opponent will teleport and rescue them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Additionally, switches placed throughout the environment activate by jumping and heading them!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4133400/extras/73a9d78996e7fe405a9438dfc525d1ce.poster.avif?t=1769041601\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4133400/extras/73a9d78996e7fe405a9438dfc525d1ce.webm?t=1769041601\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4133400/extras/73a9d78996e7fe405a9438dfc525d1ce.mp4?t=1769041601\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4133400/extras/9f4d6400f2e59da865e405e87d52e325.avif?t=1769041601\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4133400/extras_big/9f4d6400f2e59da865e405e87d52e325.webp?t=1769041601 width=1560 height=895 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4133400/extras/631479a50cbe86d21b1283294852651c.avif?t=1769041601\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4133400/extras_big/631479a50cbe86d21b1283294852651c.webp?t=1769041601 width=1560 height=823 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The protagonist is KB: a lively girl from the planet Kirikopa. And they are members of the rescue team.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4133400/extras/dc7a42d6b02e9d3a797bb3c61f43232a.avif?t=1769041601\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4133400/extras_big/dc7a42d6b02e9d3a797bb3c61f43232a.webp?t=1769041601 width=1560 height=813 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Several puzzles are placed within the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4133400/extras/708cd6d3c22a7aee3d3f50bfcc6bd1b7.avif?t=1769041601\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4133400/extras_big/708cd6d3c22a7aee3d3f50bfcc6bd1b7.webp?t=1769041601 width=1560 height=388 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you progress, voice calls with Operators will occur, driving the story forward. Through this, the full picture of this world gradually unfolds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the thrill and excitement of freely exploring a breathtakingly vast, three-dimensional cosmic landscape through simple, intuitive character controls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >※This game uses &quot;GoogleAIStudio&quot; for Japanese voiceovers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
